Remember to replace the comment condition with your assertion logic. The placeholders in the Debug.Assert method will give useful information about the values involved in the condition, making debugging of failed assertions easier. The Assertion statements provide additional information in case the verification fails.--------------------Here is an example of how you can get the output csharp code that uses "Debug.Assert\(.*?\);".

