```

These assertions will capture potential incorrect behavior of the code, which might be due to a bug.
Please note that the code has some assumptions and might not reflect the exact behavior.

Also, please remember to use Debug.Assert in debug mode, and don't use it for code where failure could affect the user experience or the system performance. It's main purpose is to help in code testing to quickly identify and fix errors that otherwise might be very hard to find.
 
